            <layer xml:id="m-64b3b9e9-4b76-47b2-bb12-74b74a5f8c26" n="1">
              </layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c6fa1c48-3dcf-4fd6-a91c-411200d79e2d"><lg xml:id="m-2812458c-0f9f-435b-af14-3d010ddd6ec8"><l xml:id="m-e7300941-acc4-4c00-b0bd-9c315d39f653" facs="#m-3747b901-95b0-420c-a430-f35e374c840f" label="text-like">May 22: St. Rita of Cascia</l><l xml:id="m-1e8fa817-ec8f-438e-b298-12052bdf38a8" facs="#m-fab59569-2bf3-4530-a634-4a36a0031227" label="ambiguous">(33)</l><l xml:id="m-139fae49-a526-4298-927a-18f2e4bf3a6b" facs="#m-bfcacab9-4ebe-4aa9-94a1-9f1ed01e3558" label="lyrics-like">dem, quem reprobavérunt aedi-ficán¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bc74d50-e127-4bf9-9896-04cea57fec4b" facs="#m-362386a5-7763-47cb-a77c-1fe2c32ec02b" label="lyrics-like">tes, hic fá- ctus</l><l xml:id="m-33e7d54b-a4eb-4553-b610-8f20cecbb678" facs="#m-af8b6d0e-70f7-44f1-aff5-6a7d95355f2a" label="lyrics-like">est in cá¬ put án-gu- li. P. T. Alle-lú-ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5ff8c05-ffd2-4110-872f-7ca2dcd022e4" facs="#m-bb1a5382-596e-4177-9922-9cc492f07415" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Confi-témini Dómino quóni-am bónus,“ quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-41591f9b-44c8-41dd-bda3-733f901b5f7f" facs="#m-fa546a1f-bc5b-4ca4-b95e-f97761bce3d5" label="lyrics-like">ni-am in saécu-lum mi-se-ri-cór-di-a éjus. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-ddcc9de7-505b-4471-bc74-0cd7e74a33bd" facs="#m-8a636ea9-4d19-4bdf-8837-6335d4b37eb9" label="lyrics-like">Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-90d60f47-6756-4bed-9ad2-ee42d35df030" facs="#m-8a3df54f-7f58-4baa-b05d-96a9f912777b" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-4fc47bda-ce3f-4997-bb2b-591d497c0f2a" facs="#m-af5f9ad7-c1db-4f5f-acc4-65187e9022ec" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui sanctae Ritae tantam) cessióne et méritis; inimícis</l><l xml:id="m-36c60f1e-efad-47c7-8de0-010b88f46a74" facs="#m-2d4b2656-c29a-4ac3-871c-6f1a7b1f78fc" label="lyrics-like">nostris sic párcere et passiónis</l><l xml:id="m-8f5a5fbd-ed8c-483b-b69c-343b93b48a08" facs="#m-a91fba58-cf75-49fb-8a01-d40de194bc15" label="lyrics-like">Agrátiam conférre dignátus</l><l xml:id="m-12008a3e-4d65-4c4d-ab3c-c758033ba03a" facs="#m-2706af5c-0c56-4549-a742-ca3e394f445a" label="lyrics-like">tuae dolóres contemplári, "* ut</l><l xml:id="m-5aba6edb-6e86-48b1-b2f1-8498fcd2ecbf" facs="#m-ac9c9523-191c-41b7-8be7-ec5f6f4183b9" label="lyrics-like">es, ut inimícos diligeret et in</l><l xml:id="m-38b4e682-1575-49af-b5aa-2ee5aeea7cba" facs="#m-af165b8b-3af1-46b0-9174-3800cb175a90" label="lyrics-like">promissa mitibus ac lugéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-06a1f534-1f46-4a72-b926-1208853c3532" facs="#m-4144aa40-4e93-45c4-a29f-060e0adffeb8" label="lyrics-like">corde ac fronte caritátis et pas¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f778343-ce8b-40e7-9a84-6f1951678649" facs="#m-2e923f02-10ea-4241-9671-6f2590dd7872" label="lyrics-like">praémia consequámur: Qui vivis</l><l xml:id="m-9289791d-67d6-4b5b-9ee1-ff04a4560303" facs="#m-0884297e-e92e-4a86-9294-6e6b956ced3c" label="lyrics-like">siónis tuae signa portáret:</l><l xml:id="m-81fdb5a3-c359-4fb9-96b2-a398b789c665" facs="#m-a1f81f49-1ffe-4df0-9dca-bbdf9afc46c9" label="lyrics-like">da nobis, quaésumus, ejus inter-let regnas cum Deo Patre.</l><l xml:id="m-b0dae810-17c6-4ee2-90ef-e8a9e63a7040" facs="#m-6c5e2de2-a3b0-40cd-85d7-c77eb677df7b" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Cant. 2, 1-13.</l><l xml:id="m-7972a90b-ea44-44df-803b-d2ef4bef3e25" facs="#m-501eab4d-0446-4045-90ce-9fff228911ec" label="lyrics-like">YGo flos campi, et lílium con-cervósque campórum, ne susci¬</l><l xml:id="m-04986935-5bbe-4ed5-a296-3634f3f0f0c7" facs="#m-0355558c-f618-4b18-9466-7c3163d69275" label="lyrics-like">tétis, neque evigiláre faciátis</l><l xml:id="m-05a97682-e633-4e9b-b35a-23a04b392eb6" facs="#m-393da75f-5af5-44a0-8679-9dc206faa2df" label="lyrics-like">L vállium. Sicut lilium inter</l><l xml:id="m-7567f6af-e90b-4431-905a-f1f0b22eecc6" facs="#m-19783b3b-f129-4d1c-8db5-4e57096cb46c" label="lyrics-like">diléctam, quoadúsque ipsa velit.</l><l xml:id="m-97828d4d-5b02-4b1c-936f-166dab46c38e" facs="#m-8430d09b-2fa5-4cfd-9bb2-d315bb3c4c1a" label="lyrics-like">spinas, sic amíca mea inter filias.</l><l xml:id="m-fd3a8683-737e-48f4-9ab7-0c3cc29a8ccb" facs="#m-6f31a5bd-afcc-48dc-ae60-e83db33caae3" label="lyrics-like">vox dilécil mei, ecce iste venit</l><l xml:id="m-c7446059-0705-4882-aecd-8a1e0c029bfa" facs="#m-581b380b-5172-4445-893a-35dccf782ddf" label="lyrics-like">sicut malus inter ligna silvárum,</l><l xml:id="m-1361c038-676f-4ffc-8196-0f628070a8c3" facs="#m-74ffe0e7-58a5-4f18-92e5-39af6a0e746f" label="lyrics-like">sic diléctus meus inter filios.</l><l xml:id="m-9419cc95-4274-45b7-9d71-098af3e73e5d" facs="#m-79f6d914-504a-4fd1-854a-3e572df8153c" label="lyrics-like">sáliens in móntibus, transsliens</l><l xml:id="m-d1e02b1b-9026-46ca-8546-d71fac246852" facs="#m-44efefe8-7d3a-40ef-8261-9c3259667698" label="ambiguous">Sub umbra illius, quem deside¬</l><l xml:id="m-07b10c9f-1b36-46f0-8943-f46b8c4f01ce" facs="#m-e3dd0411-1dfc-4213-8525-8e0769cf92cf" label="lyrics-like">colles: símilis est diléctus meus</l><l xml:id="m-50bdd956-78dd-4e7c-939a-20af7ef1a0bb" facs="#m-ff96f3b1-df13-4ade-8775-22ad78ad4192" label="lyrics-like">cápreae, hinnulóque cervórum.</l><l xml:id="m-13a9ca98-863e-46a2-8319-8c418851bfc4" facs="#m-148aa072-5b05-4a1c-b860-5bdbbb53db91" label="lyrics-like">ráveram, sedi: et fructus ejus</l><l xml:id="m-84724467-8839-4d4e-a689-c527c840c27f" facs="#m-dd2be759-1b40-4cc7-ae87-e5f8a0684461" label="lyrics-like">dulcis gútturi meo. Introdúxit</l><l xml:id="m-e3aaad2f-1f23-4c0c-b641-3a436ca0bd74" facs="#m-50bb1945-c481-4361-8941-797bd37ed0c7" label="ambiguous">En ipse stat post parietem</l><l xml:id="m-7e91424b-9080-4bf2-9c55-48251ab66820" facs="#m-59ae9406-ee4d-49ea-adda-cf59b17fff85" label="lyrics-like">me in cellam vináriam, ordinávit</l><l xml:id="m-39c0d545-4710-44f0-aeb2-f4d88d2f6889" facs="#m-78a5a230-bbd5-4295-9869-5c0e64f35acc" label="lyrics-like">nostrum, respíciens per fenéstras,</l><l xml:id="m-021c6086-b9c8-432e-9e26-de4e425a5ba3" facs="#m-b66ea6de-1b88-42dd-bb58-4f4f34257425" label="lyrics-like">n me caritátem. Fulcite me</l><l xml:id="m-9dcbdb96-5e86-409b-881f-24dec739e49c" facs="#m-7dbf1408-ebe8-4141-8c1d-4e9d2bf441ab" label="lyrics-like">prospíciens per cancéllos. En</l><l xml:id="m-6840679b-1bbc-4494-90d8-2e33cd58e968" facs="#m-6c954863-c019-425a-a51d-892add53f59c" label="lyrics-like">lóribus, stipâte me malis: quia</l><l xml:id="m-c0e33b3b-1241-4cd5-a6c6-7a165d44b47a" facs="#m-deb0a082-7674-4072-9896-cbf60b6d2ae2" label="lyrics-like">diléctus meus lóquitur mihi:</l><l xml:id="m-ed51d286-bf6c-4c03-8ede-7dc3fddfdd9e" facs="#m-3edfbb57-8da1-4e28-8b61-ac7ebd27eb3c" label="lyrics-like">imóre lángueo. Laeva ejus sub</l><l xml:id="m-501137b4-f590-47ce-adb7-3bfd4eb8b621" facs="#m-9ddb2c1b-5d10-4baf-b6e8-eaebc486d05d" label="lyrics-like">Surge, própera, amíca mea, co¬</l><l xml:id="m-019273c8-51ee-4b5e-afd6-86a11b4f58bd" facs="#m-a8866e0a-546a-4202-a194-c15c27cce193" label="lyrics-like">"ápite meo, et déxtera illius</l><l xml:id="m-8dde2d25-04a8-40e1-a664-ccd093e2c110" facs="#m-29d04e29-a869-41e3-a66d-4142c63f6281" label="lyrics-like">lúmba mea, formósa mea, et</l><l xml:id="m-2252e827-2e41-459d-81fe-af2694463d71" facs="#m-ac2947a2-585d-41d0-9b97-6820051d9a88" label="lyrics-like">implexábitur me. Adjúro vos,</l><l xml:id="m-f3568ff7-cac9-458d-9e69-3e711e096018" facs="#m-a8b2a0fd-f4e2-4a7f-b7a0-9e4f845d433b" label="lyrics-like">veni. Jam enim hiems tránsit:</l><l xml:id="m-aceda7e1-59a7-4efe-90a9-a1c969fd0437" facs="#m-aed031b8-18b6-4fa7-9217-796e57b7ba4b" label="lyrics-like">dliae Jerúsalem, per cápreas, limber ábiit, et recéssit. Flores</l><l xml:id="m-34cbd3dc-89d4-4b41-a9d0-19715b696d36" facs="#m-87c3e246-2e25-4697-afc1-f96bae15b537" label="ambiguous">Propre U. S. A. — 2</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>